sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as ProjectControls
    participant P as ProjectFiles
    participant F as FileTransfer
    participant S as WorkspaceSerializer
    participant W as Workspace
    participant H as History
    participant V as Navigator
    participant N as Notifier
    U->>C: Save (button or Ctrl/Cmd+S)
    C->>P: save()
    P->>W: stampSaved(now)
    P->>S: serialize(workspace)
    P->>F: download(slug.flow.json, JSON)
    P->>P: savedCapture = capture(), now clean
    U->>C: Open
    C->>C: confirm discard if isDirty
    C->>P: open()
    P->>F: pick()
    alt cancelled
        F-->>P: null
    else file chosen
        F-->>P: name, text
        P->>S: deserialize(JSON.parse(text))
        alt unreadable or other schemaVersion
            S-->>P: PersistenceError
            P->>N: post("project-file", transient)
            Note over P,W: current project is untouched
        else valid
            P->>W: load(snapshot)
            P->>H: reset()
            P->>V: reconcile()
            P->>P: savedCapture = capture(), now clean
        end
    end
    Note over W: Autosave also sees load, so the opened project becomes the crash-recovery copy
    Note over C: beforeunload warns while isDirty, which compares capture() with savedCapture, so undo back to the saved state is clean
